000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.    SPOINQIH.
000400 AUTHOR.        K. MOVSESIAN/JIM COFFMAN (MAINTAINER).
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.  MAR. 15, 1986.

      *****************************************************************
      *         THIS SUBROUTINE IS THE PURCHASE ORDER ITEM INQUIRY
      *         INTO THE STORES HISTORY DATA BASE 'STHIST'.
      *****************************************************************

      *****************************************************************
      **          M O D I F I C A T I O N    H I S T O R Y
      *****************************************************************
      *C  02/23/94  JEFF BUNGO  REQ #6449
      *C     ADDED ADDITIONAL FIELDS TO THE HISTORY DPOITEM FILE.
      *C     CHANGED/RECOMPILED THIS PROGRAM TO USE THE NEW FIELDS.
      *C
      *C   SEPT. 94   JE COFFMAN  REQ #6527
      *C   ADDED LOGIC TO DISPLAY THE CHAT NUMBER IF THE USER
      *C   HAS SELECTED THE OPTION TO INCLUDE CHAT NUMBERS WITH
      *C   CSIS CORPORATE CODED ITEMS.
      *C
      *C  06/10/96   JEFF BUNGO
      *C     EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C     FOR ANY BINARY DATE, SUBTRACT 19M OR 20M BEFORE CALL
      *C     TO TDATECK2 WHEN FORMATING DISPLAY DATE.
      *C
      *C  11/20/96   JEFF BUNGO
      *C     IF QS9000-TRACKING ITEM, DISPLAY F5 KEY INSTRUCTIONS
      *C     AND ALLOW F5 TO DISPLAY THE TRACKING SCREEN.
      *C---------------------------------------------------------------
      *C MAR 10, 2005  D.RAUCH       DCR01    REQUEST# 2005-78515
      *C    DISPLAY FILE PROCESSING CHANGED FROM USING ZCSISINQ
      *C    NEW DISPLAY FILE ZSINVPOI  CREATED - FORMATS COPIED
      *C    FROM ZCSISINQ.
      *C---------------------------------------------------------------
      *C MMM DD, CCYY  XXXNAMEXXX    XXX01    REQUEST# 2005-XXXXX
      *C    XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX DESC XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
      *****************************************************************

001500 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001600 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
001700 SOURCE-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
001800 OBJECT-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.

       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           LOCAL-DATA IS LOCAL-DATA-AREA
           I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DPODESCH-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLST0501
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                   WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DPOITEMH-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLST0401
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                   WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MPLTINFO-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.


           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
               ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZSPOINQIH-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
               CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL
               FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.

       FD  DPODESCH-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DPODESCH-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLST0501.

       FD  DPOITEMH-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DPOITEMH-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLST0401.

       FD  MPLTINFO-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS0501.

       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
DCR01  01  DISPLAY-REC           PIC X(2000).

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  SAVE-PCPO-SW                 PIC X.
       77  TRAK-FUNCTION                PIC X.

      *---USED FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
       01  DISPLAY-DATE-2000            PIC 9(6).
       01  TEMP-DATE.
           05  FILLER                   PIC 9(2).
           05  TEMP-YEAR                PIC 9(2).
           05  FILLER                   PIC 9(4).
       01  TEMP-DATE-9 REDEFINES TEMP-DATE  PIC 9(8).

       01  PLT-NUMBER.
           05  PLT-DIGIT-1              PIC X.
               88  A-KELLY-PLANT               VALUE "2".
           05  FILLER                   PIC X(2).

       01  KELLY-CF                     PIC S9(8)V9(4).
       01  CHECK-QTY                    PIC S9(8)V9(4).

       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X  VALUE "0".

