106400     MOVE  16 TO LANG-SETNUM.
106500     MOVE  30 TO LANG-MSGNUM.
106600     PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
106700     MOVE 99 TO FIELD-NUMBER.
106800     PERFORM  73-PGM-ERROR THRU 73-PGM-ERROR-X.
106900     GO TO  61-PROCESS-FORM1.
107000
107100 61-DETERMINE-CONT-DATASET.
107200     MOVE SPACE  TO  DE1-ITEM-TABLE.
107300     MOVE "Y"  TO  CONTINUED-SCREEN.
107400
108400     IF SAVE-CONT-DSET EQUAL "D"
108500         MOVE ZEROS               TO  LINE-SUB
108600         SUBTRACT 1               FROM DESC-SUB
108700         GO TO 61-GET-DESC-LOOP
108800     ELSE
108900     IF SAVE-CONT-DSET EQUAL "I"
109000         GO TO  61-GET-DPODESC-CALC
109100     ELSE
